# Implementation Plan: 🟠 Level 3 - Orange Belt Submission (Rise-in-Level-3)

Build and deploy a production-ready Stellar Soroban dApp in `https://github.com/priyanshu-sarjan/Rise-in-Level-3.git` by combining the visual design and AI Agent pop-up window architecture of `AI-Agent-` with the Stellar/Soroban smart contracts, inter-contract communication, event streaming, and wallet logic of `agri_freshh`.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Visual Preservation**: The main frontend visual design (AyuTrace Logistics Dashboard, Map, Products, Herbs, Community) from `AI-Agent-` will be preserved intact.
> - **Web3 Smart Contract Pop-up Integration**: The floating pop-up window in `AI-Agent-` (`AIAgentPopup`) will be enhanced into a multi-tab Web3 Hub supporting **Wallet Connection (Freighter & Testnet Keypair/Friendbot)**, **Soroban Smart Contract Operations (Inter-contract calls, Item Registration, Checkpoint Verification)**, **Real-time Event Streaming**, and **MCP Telemetry**.
> - **Smart Contracts**: Soroban Rust contracts (`TraceLinkRegistry`, `TraceLinkTracker`, `TraceLinkContract`) and EVM `AgriTraceLink.sol` will be included with unit test suites.

